OL,3,GNEWSAChief minister confirms budget
OL,4,Apublication date
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's new government will publish
OL,7,Fits 2027 budget - the first of the
OL,8,Fpolitical term - on Tuesday 29
OL,9,FSeptember, the chief minister has said.
OL,11,FSenator Lyndon Farnham also said a
OL,12,Fdebate on the proposals was scheduled
OL,13,Fto begin in the States Assembly on
OL,14,FTuesday 8 December.
OL,16,FOver the course of the debate,
OL,17,Fpoliticians will vote on any amendments
OL,18,Fproposed by backbenchers, before a
OL,19,Ffinal vote is taken on the financial
OL,20,Fplan, as amended.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
